:"东汉太保甄邯之后，家中世代为官。甄逸本人曾任上蔡令。其最著名的身份是文昭甄皇后的父亲，因此甄逸也是魏文帝曹丕的岳父，魏明帝曹叡的外祖父。去世后被追谥为敬侯。","tc":"東漢太保甄邯之后，家中世代為官。甄逸本人曾任上蔡令。其最著名的身份是文昭甄皇后的父親，因此甄逸也是魏文帝曹丕的岳父，魏明帝曹叡的外祖父。去世后被追謚為敬侯。","en":"A descendant of Grand Guardian Zhen Han of the Eastern Han dynasty, whose family served as officials for generations. Zhen Yi himself served as Magistrate of Shangcai. He is best known as the father of Empress Wenzhao, making him the father-in-law of Emperor Wen of Wei, Cao Pi, and maternal grandfather of Emperor Ming of Wei, Cao Rui. After his death, he was posthumously granted the title Marquis Jing.","jp":"東漢の太保・甄邯の末裔で、家系は代々官職に就いていた。甄逸自身は上蔡令を務めた。最もよく知られているのは文昭甄皇后の父という立場であり、魏の文帝・曹丕の岳父、明帝・曹叡の外祖父にあたる。没後、敬侯と追諡された。","kr":"동한 태보 견한의 후손으로, 가문이 대대로 관직을 지냈다. 견일 본인은 상채령을 지냈다. 가장 널리 알려진 신분은 문소견황후의 아버지라는 점으로, 위 문제 조비의 장인이자 위 명제 조예의 외조부이기도 하다. 사후 경후로 추증되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038515","remark":"","surname":"甄","surnameTc":"甄","surnameEn":"Zhen","surnameJp":"甄","surnameKr":"견","surnameOther":"","name":"逸","nameTc":"逸","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"逸","nameKr":"일","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"甄逸","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1010","gender":"0","rule":"33","force":"20","wise":"62","politics":"78","charm":"55","will":"58","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"15/15/60/15/15/49/50/15","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"7400","battleSoulPoint":"4000","debateSoulPoint":"7800","strategy":"","strategy2":"1015701","professions":"3/2/2/4/3/0/3/3/3/3/1/2/2/2/4/3/1/2/2/1/2/1/0/1